#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:158 ca9704c6c7b74360b9e3157fd1259bf2
msgid "pybroker-indicator-creator"
msgstr "pybroker-indicator-creator"

#: ../../../skills/pybroker-indicator-creator/SKILL.md:3
#: cd20fd47d3ab420d81885652f85f5202
msgid ""
"Write fast, correct PyBroker indicators: register vectorized NumPy/Numba "
"functions with `pybroker.indicator`, wire them into strategy executions "
"and models, and keep every value free of lookahead bias. Covers the "
"built-in indicator factories and vector helpers, custom Numba `@njit` "
"kernels, wrapping third-party technical analysis libraries such as TA-Lib"
" and pandas-ta, standalone computation with `IndicatorSet`, hyperparam-"
"driven indicators, and multi-timeframe interval indicators."
msgstr ""
"编写快速、正确的 PyBroker 指标：使用 `pybroker.indicator` 注册向量化的 NumPy/Numba "
"函数，将其接入策略执行函数和模型，并确保每个值都不含前视偏差。涵盖内置指标工厂和向量辅助函数、自定义 Numba `@njit` "
"内核、封装 TA-Lib 和 pandas-ta 等第三方技术分析库、使用 `IndicatorSet` 进行独立计算、由超参数驱动的指标，以及多时间框架区间指标。"

